      "openalex_id": "W2064697872",
      "doi": "10.1080/17449626.2012.672450",
      "title": "Development ethics \u2013 Why? What? How? A formulation of the field",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Des Gasper",
          "openalex_id": "A5011551248",
