      "openalex_id": "W2140509572",
      "doi": "10.3384/diss.diva-106245",
      "title": "Impossible Interculturality? : Education and the Colonial Difference in a Multicultural World",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Robert \u00c5man",
